Bio-inspired affordance learning for 6-DoF robotic grasping: A transformer-based global feature encoding approach
Zhenjie Zhao a,b,c,1, Hang Yu b,c,1, Hang Wu b,c,∗, Xuebo Zhang b,c,∗
a College of Computer Science, Nanjing University of Information Science and Technology, Nanjing, Jiangsu, China b Institute of Robotics and Automatic Information System, College of Artificial Intelligence, Nankai University, Tianjin, China c Tianjin Key Laboratory of Intelligent Robotics, Nankai University, Tianjin, China
ARTICLE INFO
Keywords:
